## Timer state after recovery

All five public-SFW timers were enabled, active, waiting and had a future run:

- Nurture: 2026-09-03 15:18:00 UTC.
- S9 health: 2026-09-03 15:19:00 UTC.
- S10 health: 2026-09-03 15:19:51 UTC.
- Audience: 2026-09-03 15:30:00 UTC.
- Daily report: 2026-09-04 04:23:00 UTC.

## Final health

- S7, S8 landing, S8 Telegram, S10 WMS and nginx: active, `NRestarts=0`.
- `wantmeseen.com`, health, privacy, terms and imprint: HTTP 200.
- `wantmeseen.de`: HTTP 308 to `https://wantmeseen.com/`.
- Public health retained all Adult/identity/AVS/payment/publishing/beta/production
  boundaries as false.
- Adult S0, S3, S3.1 and S4 runtimes: inactive.
- Control and application repository ownership: `chatops:chatops`, mode 2770.

## Outcome

Audience, nurture and health automation is recurring again and protected by
future-elapse guards. The next product focus may collect the already approved
SFW funnel events from landing through referral. Yoti remains technically
ready but waiting on its external organization status.
